WEBVTT

00:00:03.179 --> 00:00:05.285
Open a chat with the profile.

00:00:05.285 --> 00:00:10.039
An Attach files button appears, with the list of formats that it accepts.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:13.333
Click Attach files, and choose the file.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:16.300
Here it is the return policy of a company.

00:00:16.752 --> 00:00:19.824
Then ask something that only the file answers:

00:00:19.824 --> 00:00:21.892
can I return opened software?

00:00:22.363 --> 00:00:25.018
The assistant answers from the file:

00:00:25.018 --> 00:00:27.863
no, opened software cannot be returned.

